<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 09-JUL					     .</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 09-JUL					     .</headline>
<text>
<p>Hurricane Dolores, with 80 mph winds, is centered about 1100 miles west southwest of the southern tip of Baja California in the eastern Pacific, moving west northwest at 13 mph. It will continue to track out to sea to the west northwest as it continues to weaken. It is a threat to shipping only.  </p>
<p>There are no further statements at this time.</p>
</text>
